WEBVTT

00:20.350 --> 00:24.390
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:24.390 --> 00:30.090
♪ May we pass by the magnificent scenery ♪

00:30.980 --> 00:35.140
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:35.140 --> 00:40.910
♪ Could it be that both of us
are filled with desolation? ♪

00:41.790 --> 00:45.630
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:45.630 --> 00:51.400
♪ May we lead such a life ♪

00:52.350 --> 00:56.520
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:56.520 --> 01:01.900
♪ Turning back, you and I ♪

01:05.740 --> 01:07.270
♪ Seize the current moment ♪

01:07.270 --> 01:10.920
♪ The sky is painted
with a gentle pallet of pastel colors ♪

01:10.920 --> 01:15.920
♪ Let's walk together ♪

01:16.360 --> 01:17.970
♪ Even if ♪

01:17.970 --> 01:21.660
♪ The snow in front of us ♪

01:21.680 --> 01:23.170
♪ Will dye our hair white ♪

01:23.170 --> 01:27.210
♪ In an instant ♪

01:27.210 --> 01:28.310
[Joy of Life Season 2]

01:28.310 --> 01:30.780
[Adapted from Mao Ni's Joy of Life
on Yuewen Group's Qidian platform]

01:30.780 --> 01:34.300
[Episode 11]

01:34.520 --> 01:36.319
It doesn't matter
whether his name is registered or not.

01:36.319 --> 01:38.000
He belongs to the Fan family anyway.

01:38.280 --> 01:39.200
He may be naughty.

01:39.200 --> 01:40.500
I will continue to guide him.

01:40.520 --> 01:41.780
If he really gets into trouble,

01:41.800 --> 01:42.900
I have his back.

01:42.920 --> 01:43.579
Your Majesty,

01:43.599 --> 01:45.340
he is always like this.

01:45.360 --> 01:47.440
Only you can understand him,
Your Majesty.

01:54.119 --> 01:56.960
I have been understanding, haven't I?

01:59.599 --> 02:00.800
But

02:02.039 --> 02:04.160
who has ever considered me?

02:06.200 --> 02:08.560
Your Majesty, what do you mean?

02:09.399 --> 02:11.980
When Fan Xian and Chengze

02:12.000 --> 02:13.900
were pitting against each other
in the hall,

02:13.920 --> 02:15.759
neither of you

02:16.399 --> 02:17.479
stepped forward.

02:18.200 --> 02:19.280
Why is that?

02:25.999 --> 02:26.979
You claimed he smuggled,

02:26.999 --> 02:28.819
but no solid evidence has been found.

02:28.839 --> 02:31.320
Now, you switch
to the corruption investigation.

02:31.399 --> 02:33.759
All of you took turns to chip in.

02:34.119 --> 02:36.000
Is the corruption really your goal?

02:37.519 --> 02:39.120
Your goal

02:39.800 --> 02:42.020
is my son.

02:42.040 --> 02:43.479
Do you really think

02:43.839 --> 02:46.699
I won't care for my son at all?

02:46.719 --> 02:48.819
I didn't say a word just now.

02:48.839 --> 02:50.419
Chen Pingping was speaking all the time.

02:50.439 --> 02:52.040
Your Majesty, I think

02:52.040 --> 02:54.219
since the dispute has started,

02:54.239 --> 02:55.959
it's better to escalate it.

03:00.360 --> 03:01.979
He is my son.

03:01.999 --> 03:03.499
He is also the prince of the Qing State,

03:03.519 --> 03:04.599
Your Majesty.

03:05.080 --> 03:06.819
The Second Prince has been intelligent.

03:06.839 --> 03:08.140
After years of effort,

03:08.160 --> 03:09.959
he has built up his own influence.

03:10.200 --> 03:12.320
He himself has nothing wrong,

03:12.760 --> 03:17.499
but people around him
may harbor ill intentions.

03:17.519 --> 03:19.440
They should be cleared out.

03:20.279 --> 03:21.600
Cleared out?

03:26.559 --> 03:30.000
You are trying to clear out my son.

03:35.480 --> 03:38.300
The one who could do this
can only be Fan Xian.

03:38.320 --> 03:40.659
He might be hung out to dry
when things are over.

03:40.679 --> 03:42.759
He won't. Fan Xian has a brain on him.

03:43.040 --> 03:45.160
He won't be on the downtrodden side.

03:45.239 --> 03:47.400
As you could see early this morning,

03:47.600 --> 03:49.460
the Crown Prince's aides were agitating.

03:49.480 --> 03:52.720
Fan Xian just shouldn't
get involved in this.

03:53.200 --> 03:54.379
It wasn't the Crown Prince.

03:54.399 --> 03:56.519
But those are his aides.

03:58.239 --> 03:59.819
It wasn't the Crown Prince.

03:59.839 --> 04:02.160
Who else could instruct
the Crown Prince's aides

04:02.160 --> 04:03.430
except for the Crown Prince himself?

04:03.439 --> 04:05.759
The Qing State's laws are strict.

04:05.839 --> 04:06.919
I feel

04:07.360 --> 04:09.359
much honored.

04:12.880 --> 04:14.120
What does that mean?

04:27.239 --> 04:29.820
What was said in the assembly earlier

04:29.840 --> 04:31.539
has gotten His Majesty's nerve.

04:31.559 --> 04:32.680
Which one?

04:32.920 --> 04:35.460
Your Majesty,
you are the ruler of the state.

04:35.480 --> 04:37.519
There is nothing
you should be hidden from.

04:37.639 --> 04:40.539
However, as the head
of the Six Ministries,

04:40.559 --> 04:43.260
I feel a duty to share your burden.

04:43.280 --> 04:45.099
If we were to burden you
with such matters,

04:45.119 --> 04:46.780
over time,

04:46.800 --> 04:49.159
the Six Ministries might slack off

04:49.360 --> 04:51.639
and law enforcement would be undermined.

04:51.920 --> 04:53.320
He was right...

04:58.079 --> 05:00.240
So the one who egged on
the Crown Prince's aides

05:00.679 --> 05:02.079
was Prime Minister Lin.

05:03.280 --> 05:05.839
He intends to instigate
a power struggle between princes.

05:07.119 --> 05:08.639
But will he benefit

05:09.439 --> 05:11.279
by doing so?

05:11.400 --> 05:13.360
He also wants to find out

05:13.759 --> 05:16.560
who the future ruler
of the Qing State will be.

05:20.119 --> 05:21.480
Doesn't he

05:22.160 --> 05:24.460
see too far ahead?

05:24.480 --> 05:26.360
Not only his vision

05:26.920 --> 05:29.480
but also his hand has overreached.

06:04.400 --> 06:06.440
Did the Imperial Inspectorate

06:06.759 --> 06:08.959
really sort out
the list of corrupt officials?

06:08.999 --> 06:10.140
Absolutely true.

06:10.160 --> 06:12.800
I guess the Imperial Inspectorate

06:13.119 --> 06:15.240
didn't want to have a hand in it.

06:15.920 --> 06:18.539
It was you

06:18.559 --> 06:20.360
who handpicked the names.

06:22.559 --> 06:24.120
You are smart, Your Highness.

06:27.230 --> 06:28.480
So, did you admit this?

06:28.639 --> 06:29.880
Why would I not?

06:29.990 --> 06:32.260
Everyone has the duty
to eradicate evil for the state.

06:32.280 --> 06:33.439
My personal little efforts

06:33.439 --> 06:35.839
are just part
of the Imperial Inspectorate's honor.

06:36.199 --> 06:39.120
The names on that list are all my aides.

06:39.400 --> 06:41.360
You have a knack for picking.

06:44.040 --> 06:45.320
They are your aides?

06:50.010 --> 06:51.739
Please forgive me, Your Highness.

06:51.759 --> 06:54.959
You should know I only came
to the Capital for a short time.

06:55.239 --> 06:56.859
I dare to ask,

06:56.879 --> 06:59.340
among the Six Ministries,
the Nine Courts, and all yamens,

06:59.360 --> 07:01.120
which department

07:01.199 --> 07:04.279
and unit

07:04.480 --> 07:06.159
do your aides serve?

07:10.639 --> 07:11.900
Personal acquaintances.

07:11.920 --> 07:13.159
They are just

07:14.119 --> 07:15.199
my friends.

07:19.110 --> 07:20.450
That will be all right, then.

07:20.470 --> 07:21.800
Don't worry, Your Highness.

07:21.879 --> 07:23.059
Befriending the wrong people

07:23.079 --> 07:24.520
isn't considered illegal.

07:24.840 --> 07:26.160
I'm truly glad to hear that.

07:26.160 --> 07:28.120
You had better watch out from now on.

07:34.999 --> 07:36.680
My carriage is in front.

07:37.350 --> 07:38.659
Do you mind walking with me for a while?

07:38.679 --> 07:39.759
No problem.

07:40.280 --> 07:43.090
Taking a walk
isn't considered illegal either.

07:51.800 --> 07:52.900
In good conscience,

07:52.920 --> 07:54.299
ever since you came here,

07:54.319 --> 07:55.920
I have always admired you.

07:55.920 --> 07:57.659
I even open my heart to you.

07:57.679 --> 07:58.700
In what again?

07:58.720 --> 08:00.320
I didn't catch it.

08:01.879 --> 08:03.500
Even at this point,

08:03.520 --> 08:04.979
I'm still willing to take a step back.

08:04.999 --> 08:07.260
It's fine if you investigate
the names on that list.

08:07.280 --> 08:08.060
I just hope

08:08.080 --> 08:09.340
this is the end of it.

08:09.360 --> 08:11.500
You shouldn't go too far.

08:11.520 --> 08:13.079
Hark at you.

08:13.079 --> 08:14.079
This is too much.

08:14.079 --> 08:16.460
How to investigate and how deeply it will
be investigated depends on the state's law.

08:16.460 --> 08:17.780
No one can bargain over this.

08:17.800 --> 08:18.990
If you don't believe me, go and ask

08:19.010 --> 08:21.100
those censors
in the Imperial Procuratorate.

08:21.480 --> 08:23.120
You are driving me into a corner.

08:23.520 --> 08:25.159
Why are you afraid if you are clean?

08:25.280 --> 08:26.179
I'm not afraid of death.

08:26.199 --> 08:27.299
How brave of you.

08:27.319 --> 08:29.639
Anyone in the Capital dies,

08:31.600 --> 08:33.160
but it won't be me.

08:43.990 --> 08:45.550
Mind your words, Your Highness.

08:46.280 --> 08:47.920
Only tortoises

08:48.719 --> 08:50.119
live the longest.

09:01.520 --> 09:05.560
Of course,
you are quite carefree as of now.

09:05.599 --> 09:06.780
Why would I be worried

09:06.800 --> 09:08.359
when I abide by the law?

09:10.959 --> 09:13.280
You are still new in the Capital.

09:13.359 --> 09:15.119
If you stay here long enough,

09:15.359 --> 09:17.400
you can expand your own network.

09:25.400 --> 09:26.920
You are right, Your Highness.

09:27.400 --> 09:29.680
I'm all alone as a latecomer.

09:30.880 --> 09:34.119
Fortunately, I'm holding a position.

09:34.160 --> 09:36.959
So, I don't think I'm on my own.

09:59.559 --> 10:01.920
You sent Fan Sizhe northward.

10:15.800 --> 10:17.640
You do know everything, You Highness.

10:19.000 --> 10:20.760
You are so cruel.

10:20.959 --> 10:21.839
Northern Qi is cold.

10:21.839 --> 10:24.959
Why do you have the heart
to send your brother over to suffer?

10:25.760 --> 10:26.839
I'm soft-hearted.

10:26.840 --> 10:28.359
I can't stand to see
brothers being separated.

10:28.359 --> 10:30.819
So I had my man follow him.

10:30.839 --> 10:31.439
By now,

10:31.439 --> 10:34.560
they should've brought him back.

10:34.800 --> 10:36.419
Your Highness, you are sentimental.

10:36.439 --> 10:39.440
It would be perfect if you were cautious
when making friends.

10:42.359 --> 10:43.819
My carriage is right ahead.

10:43.839 --> 10:45.260
Please stop here.

10:45.280 --> 10:47.140
Let's catch up again when Sizhe is back.

10:47.160 --> 10:48.140
Safe trip.

10:48.160 --> 10:49.640
Our days are plenty ahead.

11:10.640 --> 11:11.720
Mr. Fan,

11:12.120 --> 11:14.400
if they really captured
Young Master Sizhe back,

11:14.479 --> 11:16.320
it would be troublesome.

11:32.280 --> 11:32.850
Bi'an.

11:32.870 --> 11:33.819
Yes, Your Highness.

11:33.839 --> 11:35.479
You were right.

11:36.599 --> 11:37.500
Sorry?

11:37.520 --> 11:39.160
I must give a response.

11:40.000 --> 11:41.320
I shouldn't compromise.

11:43.040 --> 11:43.800
What should I do?

11:43.820 --> 11:46.239
I heard that someone died
in the Baoyue Pleasure House.

11:48.079 --> 11:49.159
Baoyue...

11:49.400 --> 11:50.480
No, there isn't.

11:51.280 --> 11:53.239
Didn't I just tell you?

11:55.870 --> 11:57.280
Understood, Your Highness.

11:59.325 --> 12:02.395
[Baoyue Pleasure House]

12:26.959 --> 12:28.680
Help!

12:28.839 --> 12:30.400
Help!

12:34.520 --> 12:35.839
Help!

12:39.959 --> 12:41.039
Help...

12:48.640 --> 12:49.579
What happened?

12:49.599 --> 12:50.999
Hurry and take a look.

12:51.719 --> 12:52.500
Let's leave.

12:52.520 --> 12:53.600
Come on.

12:58.225 --> 13:00.280
[Imperial Procuratorate]

13:00.280 --> 13:02.020
After looking into
the names on the list,

13:02.040 --> 13:03.179
officials in the Capital

13:03.199 --> 13:05.160
with monetary issues

13:05.199 --> 13:06.719
are quite a lot.

13:12.319 --> 13:14.079
These miscreants

13:14.280 --> 13:15.780
must be punished!

13:15.800 --> 13:17.059
Should we really investigate them?

13:17.079 --> 13:19.059
By the look of the results,

13:19.079 --> 13:21.640
most of them are related
to the Second Prince.

13:22.240 --> 13:23.719
He is just a prince.

13:25.199 --> 13:26.539
As censors,

13:26.559 --> 13:30.100
we should even be brave enough
to impeach the Emperor.

13:30.120 --> 13:32.680
Dig deeper.

13:33.439 --> 13:34.939
I shall let His Majesty see

13:34.959 --> 13:38.119
that the Imperial Inspectorate
isn't the only capable one.

13:38.359 --> 13:39.539
There's a death case!

13:39.559 --> 13:40.800
There's a death case!

13:41.000 --> 13:42.119
A death case!

13:43.839 --> 13:44.620
Where?

13:44.640 --> 13:46.780
It's a brothel
named Baoyue Pleasure House.

13:46.800 --> 13:47.670
Someone beat a courtesan

13:47.679 --> 13:49.220
to death at the entrance.

13:49.240 --> 13:51.100
That's the Capital Magistrate's duty,

13:51.120 --> 13:52.490
not ours.

13:52.510 --> 13:54.300
The head of the Baoyue Pleasure House
disappears.

13:54.320 --> 13:56.260
But she left a letter
for the Capital Magistrate,

13:56.280 --> 13:59.320
saying the owner is Fan Sizhe.

14:00.839 --> 14:02.400
Fan Sizhe?

14:03.240 --> 14:04.780
Fan Jian's son.

14:04.800 --> 14:06.239
Fan Xian's younger brother.

14:10.400 --> 14:12.560
The Fan family runs a brothel?

14:13.160 --> 14:15.520
It's said
they forcefully pimped womenfolks.

14:15.839 --> 14:16.830
Perhaps the death

14:16.850 --> 14:18.490
of this courtesan has something
to do with this.

14:18.510 --> 14:20.150
Has the Capital Magistrate
taken any action?

14:20.150 --> 14:21.740
Not only the Capital Magistrate

14:21.760 --> 14:23.260
but Fan Xian has also arrived.

14:23.280 --> 14:24.640
Fan Xian?

14:26.280 --> 14:29.920
He is trying to interrupt
the investigation.

14:45.320 --> 14:46.479
Mr. Fan.

14:48.000 --> 14:49.080
This woman

14:49.439 --> 14:51.280
was beaten to death.

14:51.319 --> 14:53.140
People around here witnessed it.

14:53.160 --> 14:54.250
The coroner is on his way here.

14:54.270 --> 14:56.819
It shouldn't be a different conclusion
for the cause of her death.

14:56.839 --> 14:57.919
Besides,

14:58.199 --> 14:59.540
Yuan Meng disappeared.

14:59.560 --> 15:01.640
The Capital Magistrate
is looking into it.

15:02.120 --> 15:03.200
Mr. Fan.

15:03.359 --> 15:04.439
Mr. Fan,

15:04.520 --> 15:06.440
Yuan Meng left a letter.

15:07.880 --> 15:10.299
It writes that Fan Sizhe owns
the Baoyue Pleasure House.

15:10.319 --> 15:11.579
Besides, they forced women

15:11.599 --> 15:13.419
into prostitution and beat them.

15:13.439 --> 15:16.830
A copy of this letter
is sent to the Capital Magistrate.

15:20.479 --> 15:21.719
Who is the deceased?

15:22.079 --> 15:23.680
It's a courtesan.

15:53.959 --> 15:56.520
This is Jin's daughter?

15:59.640 --> 16:01.320
Why was she still here?

16:01.760 --> 16:03.920
Didn't I return her indenture
and set her free?

16:04.359 --> 16:05.560
Mr. Fan,

16:05.839 --> 16:08.839
once a woman enters a brothel,

16:09.439 --> 16:10.839
they can never

16:10.920 --> 16:13.079
get rid of the stigma for life.

16:13.520 --> 16:15.879
Besides, her father has passed.

16:15.959 --> 16:18.320
She had nowhere else to go.

16:23.559 --> 16:24.839
Did the murderers

16:25.439 --> 16:27.320
kill her by choice?

16:27.559 --> 16:28.639
Mr. Fan,

16:29.719 --> 16:32.680
the guard who witnessed the murder said

16:33.040 --> 16:35.060
that after the three men
entered the premises,

16:35.080 --> 16:36.210
they didn't ask any questions

16:36.230 --> 16:37.920
or intentionally select anyone.

16:38.160 --> 16:41.450
They assaulted Miss Jin

16:41.470 --> 16:42.839
the moment they saw her

16:43.040 --> 16:44.459
and beat her to death

16:44.479 --> 16:46.560
without asking who she was.

16:52.559 --> 16:54.479
So, this was a random choice.

16:58.280 --> 17:00.079
Perhaps they couldn't care less

17:00.240 --> 17:01.760
about who died.

17:05.919 --> 17:07.280
Right over there.

17:20.860 --> 17:22.250
Where are the murderers?

17:24.040 --> 17:25.160
Mr. Fan,

17:25.559 --> 17:27.960
they left right after she died.

17:28.119 --> 17:29.800
We are tracking them down.

17:30.760 --> 17:32.560
Don't let them leave the Capital.

17:32.800 --> 17:33.740
Please rest assured.

17:33.760 --> 17:36.119
The murderers will not get away with it.

17:39.040 --> 17:41.870
Wang, didn't I order to guard
the Baoyue Pleasure House

17:41.879 --> 17:43.819
and forbid anyone
from entering or leaving?

17:43.839 --> 17:45.280
They did, Mr. Fan.

17:45.559 --> 17:47.420
But the murderers are skilled.

17:47.440 --> 17:50.379
They purposely did it
to get you involved.

17:50.399 --> 17:52.560
They caught us off guard.

17:52.919 --> 17:54.839
Because they treat human lives

17:55.520 --> 17:57.639
like dirt.

17:57.879 --> 17:59.919
It doesn't matter who dies.

18:04.760 --> 18:06.800
Even Heaven can't tolerate this.

18:11.919 --> 18:13.119
Deng Ziyue,

18:13.440 --> 18:15.359
[Baoyue Pleasure House]
hunt Yuan Meng down.

18:15.440 --> 18:16.490
Yes.

18:16.510 --> 18:18.310
[Imperial Procuratorate]
Running a brothel business

18:18.319 --> 18:19.040
is considered

18:19.040 --> 18:21.960
a humiliation for the officials
and the well-educated community.

18:22.119 --> 18:23.740
Plus, the forced prostitution

18:23.760 --> 18:25.220
and the murder case

18:25.240 --> 18:26.679
are utterly unforgivable.

18:27.440 --> 18:29.159
I'm going to issue an impeachment.

18:31.480 --> 18:33.139
Against Fan Sizhe?

18:33.159 --> 18:34.899
Not just him

18:34.919 --> 18:37.639
but also Fan Jian and Fan Xian.

18:37.919 --> 18:40.980
Given what the Fan family has done,

18:41.000 --> 18:43.030
they must give an explanation.

18:43.050 --> 18:45.299
But the corruption investigation
we are conducting

18:45.319 --> 18:47.139
has already involved many parties.

18:47.159 --> 18:48.980
Do we still have
to get the Fan family involved?

18:49.000 --> 18:50.619
We have a duty

18:50.639 --> 18:52.119
to monitor all officials.

18:52.319 --> 18:53.579
No matter who they are,

18:53.599 --> 18:55.119
we won't back down.

18:58.440 --> 19:00.040
The rain finally stops.

19:01.079 --> 19:03.000
I hate rainy days.

19:04.159 --> 19:05.239
By the way,

19:05.559 --> 19:07.240
what's the name

19:07.639 --> 19:09.040
of that courtesan?

19:10.559 --> 19:11.960
I don't know.

19:12.240 --> 19:13.599
Should I look into it?

19:13.680 --> 19:14.760
Forget it.

19:14.960 --> 19:16.200
Never mind that.

19:16.839 --> 19:18.560
No one bothers to remember her.

19:19.960 --> 19:21.079
Well,

19:22.359 --> 19:24.200
after this rain,

19:25.639 --> 19:27.520
how many ants would die?

19:29.560 --> 19:30.720
Your Highness,

19:31.040 --> 19:32.520
everything is set.

19:32.559 --> 19:34.339
When those three suspects are captured,

19:34.359 --> 19:36.679
Fan Xian will be doomed.

19:39.900 --> 19:41.620
[Fan's Residence]

19:44.559 --> 19:45.000
Fan.

19:45.000 --> 19:46.790
What brings you here, Prince Jing?

19:46.840 --> 19:48.420
[Li Hongcheng, Prince Jing]
I swear to Heaven,

19:48.440 --> 19:50.420
I really have no idea
where Yuan Meng went.

19:50.440 --> 19:51.879
I have nothing to do with this.

19:51.879 --> 19:53.839
Don't worry. I will look into it

19:53.840 --> 19:55.359
and not blame an innocent man.

19:56.240 --> 19:57.320
Fan,

19:57.599 --> 19:59.700
I know you are investigating this case.

19:59.720 --> 20:00.980
Can you please

20:01.000 --> 20:03.220
not reveal my relationship
with Yuan Meng?

20:03.240 --> 20:06.359
After all, this concerns a death case.
It might affect my reputation.

20:06.480 --> 20:07.879
Fan, wait.

20:08.919 --> 20:10.800
Please tell Ruoruo

20:11.000 --> 20:12.619
that since the marriage was arranged,

20:12.639 --> 20:14.359
I have stopped seeing Yuan Meng.

20:14.399 --> 20:15.639
Prince Jing,

20:16.760 --> 20:18.439
you should leave the Second Prince.

20:19.359 --> 20:22.119
I don't want
to arrest you one day myself.

20:57.350 --> 20:58.520
Did you ask for me?

20:58.599 --> 21:00.200
I have already known

21:00.220 --> 21:02.260
what happened
in the Baoyue Pleasure House.

21:03.480 --> 21:05.830
Please pardon me
for getting the family into trouble.

21:06.520 --> 21:09.119
We are a family. Don't say that.

21:11.040 --> 21:14.639
You did nothing wrong.
You don't have to apologize.

21:16.559 --> 21:17.619
Anyway, don't worry.

21:17.639 --> 21:18.980
We sent Fan Sizhe away early.

21:19.000 --> 21:19.980
He won't get involved

21:20.000 --> 21:21.059
in the death case.

21:21.079 --> 21:23.760
But Fan Sizhe isn't the target.

21:24.520 --> 21:25.600
Right.

21:27.960 --> 21:29.740
Lai Mingcheng
of the Imperial Procuratorate

21:29.760 --> 21:31.439
is issuing another impeachment.

21:32.879 --> 21:34.030
Of course, he would.

21:34.159 --> 21:34.899
Are you not angry?

21:34.919 --> 21:36.839
These censors

21:37.440 --> 21:38.760
are pretty good.

21:38.839 --> 21:40.280
We can befriend them.

21:40.480 --> 21:43.599
How will you deal
with the impeachment later?

21:44.800 --> 21:46.180
I'm not giving any response.

21:46.200 --> 21:47.790
Before finding the culprit,

21:47.810 --> 21:49.059
I'm not attending the assembly.

21:49.079 --> 21:50.639
This isn't appropriate.

21:52.520 --> 21:53.600
Father,

21:54.319 --> 21:55.399
do you

21:56.040 --> 21:57.480
trust me?

22:00.639 --> 22:02.339
What do you make

22:02.359 --> 22:03.639
of Fan Xian?

22:06.359 --> 22:07.800
Be honest.

22:08.200 --> 22:11.200
Are you referring
to the Baoyue Pleasure House?

22:11.919 --> 22:13.070
Just anything.

22:14.240 --> 22:15.320
All right.

22:17.040 --> 22:18.359
I think

22:19.200 --> 22:21.599
something is amiss.

22:21.839 --> 22:24.200
The Baoyue Pleasure House incident
suddenly pops up

22:24.280 --> 22:27.480
during the ongoing
corruption investigation.

22:28.639 --> 22:30.000
This seems to me

22:30.839 --> 22:33.639
like a conspiracy.

22:34.119 --> 22:35.399
I can't hear you.

22:36.919 --> 22:39.599
I think this is a conspiracy.

22:43.440 --> 22:45.439
Do you really think that way?

22:49.520 --> 22:51.359
Those officials

22:51.720 --> 22:53.660
who advocated for Lai Mingcheng that day

22:53.680 --> 22:56.000
are your aides. Why?

22:59.190 --> 23:00.320
Your Majesty,

23:00.639 --> 23:01.879
I swear

23:02.040 --> 23:03.780
I didn't know about this.

23:03.800 --> 23:04.980
This is only trivial.

23:05.000 --> 23:07.480
Why are you shaking in your boots?

23:28.359 --> 23:29.439
Come.

23:33.200 --> 23:34.280
Sit.

23:41.950 --> 23:43.240
Thank you, Your Majesty.

23:58.399 --> 23:59.760
Are you sitting firmly?

24:12.639 --> 24:13.870
Keep this in mind.

24:14.399 --> 24:17.480
Keep yourself firm
when you encounter anything.

24:17.559 --> 24:19.720
Stay firm,

24:19.839 --> 24:21.359
especially

24:21.960 --> 24:23.960
when you are the Crown Prince.

24:24.440 --> 24:25.800
Do you hear me?

24:29.839 --> 24:31.960
Still playing dumb with me?

24:33.199 --> 24:34.399
Go

24:34.839 --> 24:36.720
and ask your mother.

24:50.079 --> 24:52.040
His Majesty asks you to see me?

24:52.520 --> 24:53.699
Yes.

24:54.760 --> 24:56.520
Even if Father didn't,

24:56.680 --> 24:58.960
I would still visit you.

25:02.119 --> 25:04.079
Whether or not you come,

25:04.680 --> 25:06.520
His Majesty won't care.

25:08.079 --> 25:09.919
I suppose

25:10.599 --> 25:12.240
His Majesty has already forgotten

25:12.839 --> 25:15.119
what his empress looked like.

25:20.879 --> 25:22.520
He sent you here

25:23.870 --> 25:25.879
because you couldn't understand
what he said.

25:30.520 --> 25:31.760
Tell me

25:33.839 --> 25:35.800
what he said to you.

25:36.079 --> 25:37.560
What else could it be?

25:37.760 --> 25:40.020
The Fans' sickness

25:40.040 --> 25:41.790
is an outright lie.

25:41.810 --> 25:43.059
Yes, everyone knows that.

25:43.079 --> 25:44.460
But since they said they are sick,

25:44.480 --> 25:46.260
we can't force them
to attend the assembly.

25:46.280 --> 25:49.320
People might think
we are overbearing if this gets out.

25:50.440 --> 25:51.460
What about Fan Sizhe?

25:51.480 --> 25:53.220
He is not in the Capital.

25:53.240 --> 25:53.880
Where did he go?

25:53.900 --> 25:55.910
Get to the bottom of this.
Capture him back for interrogation.

25:55.919 --> 25:57.020
We can't find out his whereabouts.

25:57.020 --> 25:59.280
The Fans are sick,
and they refuse to accept guests.

25:59.359 --> 26:02.099
I don't believe
they can stay sick forever.

26:02.119 --> 26:04.159
What should we do, then?

26:05.159 --> 26:06.239
Just wait.

26:06.860 --> 26:09.139
After all, the murderers
of the Baoyue Pleasure House case

26:09.159 --> 26:10.520
are still at large.

26:11.319 --> 26:14.119
In the meantime, continue
with the corruption investigation.

26:14.680 --> 26:17.919
Neither the Fans nor corrupt officials
can get away with it.

26:18.359 --> 26:19.560
Yes, Mr. Lai.

26:26.190 --> 26:28.940
The Baoyue Pleasure House case
is circulating among the populace.

26:28.960 --> 26:31.200
Many are suspecting the Fan family.

26:31.720 --> 26:34.539
That being said, Fan Xian
has the title of Immortal Poet.

26:34.559 --> 26:37.020
Many believe there must be more to it.

26:37.040 --> 26:38.839
How nice it is to be a poet.

26:40.599 --> 26:42.299
Should the murderers be arrested by now?

26:42.319 --> 26:43.260
No rush.

26:43.280 --> 26:45.919
This might seem rather obvious.

26:50.319 --> 26:51.640
The Fans took furlough.

26:51.660 --> 26:53.660
They don't receive guests
or attend the assembly.

26:53.680 --> 26:55.780
But this can't continue for long.

26:55.800 --> 26:58.119
Are they trying to stall time
to find the murderers?

26:58.520 --> 26:59.800
Since they are sick,

26:59.879 --> 27:00.780
they need treatment.

27:00.800 --> 27:01.880
Treatment?

27:02.359 --> 27:04.339
Send for the best imperial physician

27:04.359 --> 27:05.720
to the Fan's Residence

27:05.800 --> 27:07.000
to check on them.

27:07.050 --> 27:08.690
Will they shut the physician out?

27:09.000 --> 27:11.079
Patients shutting the physician out

27:11.720 --> 27:13.839
sounds quite unreasonable.

27:14.280 --> 27:16.000
If they are found to be healthy,

27:16.570 --> 27:18.159
they are deceiving the Emperor.

27:20.960 --> 27:22.040
I'm going now.

27:31.240 --> 27:33.119
Why do you protect the Fan family?

27:33.839 --> 27:36.240
Did he promise to serve you?

27:36.639 --> 27:37.760
He didn't.

27:38.440 --> 27:39.679
But after all,

27:40.000 --> 27:41.839
he is fighting against Chengze.

27:43.359 --> 27:45.359
Let them compete with each other.

27:45.800 --> 27:47.679
You can watch from the side.

27:48.159 --> 27:49.879
Why do you meddle?

27:51.680 --> 27:53.800
After all, he is my ally.

27:57.079 --> 27:59.200
That's why he said that.

28:01.440 --> 28:03.280
He asked for your opinion

28:03.399 --> 28:06.919
because he wanted you
to observe their fight clearly.

28:08.079 --> 28:09.839
He wanted you to sit firmly

28:10.319 --> 28:12.599
because he was advising you
not to meddle

28:12.760 --> 28:14.599
even if you had figured anything out.

28:15.200 --> 28:16.960
Sit on your hands

28:17.680 --> 28:19.159
and watch them fight.

28:20.240 --> 28:22.119
Don't get attached to any parties,

28:22.440 --> 28:24.760
and you will discern
if there is an opportunity.

28:26.960 --> 28:28.800
He is teaching you

28:29.119 --> 28:30.899
how to be a crown prince.

28:30.919 --> 28:32.439
Why couldn't he

28:32.520 --> 28:33.919
tell me directly?

28:35.839 --> 28:39.720
The Emperor's mind is unpredictable.

28:41.399 --> 28:42.720
As for

28:43.559 --> 28:47.159
those officials who supported
Lai Mingcheng in the hall...

28:47.319 --> 28:48.899
His Majesty knows

28:48.919 --> 28:50.439
it wasn't my doing.

28:51.559 --> 28:53.560
He just wanted to verify this.

28:54.040 --> 28:55.520
Who could it be?

28:55.760 --> 28:57.240
After all, Fan Xian

28:57.399 --> 28:59.720
is Prime Minister Lin's
future son-in-law.

29:03.480 --> 29:04.839
Lin Ruofu?

29:08.839 --> 29:09.899
Did you figure that out?

29:09.919 --> 29:11.040
I knew it all along.

29:11.559 --> 29:12.639
His Majesty

29:13.079 --> 29:14.399
also knew.

29:18.359 --> 29:20.960
So you understood

29:21.960 --> 29:23.760
His Majesty's advice.

29:25.040 --> 29:26.960
You didn't have to ask me at all.

29:28.399 --> 29:30.040
Listening to your guidance

29:30.720 --> 29:33.040
makes me happy.

29:33.599 --> 29:35.240
Since you understood,

29:35.480 --> 29:36.780
why pretend not to?

29:36.800 --> 29:37.880
Mother,

29:38.200 --> 29:39.679
for the Crown Prince,

29:40.119 --> 29:42.679
isn't ignorance the wisdom?

29:46.119 --> 29:47.439
You are the Crown Prince,

29:48.760 --> 29:50.280
but you are also his son.

30:00.440 --> 30:02.320
Actually, you are a lot like him.

30:03.470 --> 30:05.700
One grieves over the misfortune
of their own kind.

30:06.760 --> 30:08.839
How could you use that here?

30:11.000 --> 30:12.159
I believe

30:13.040 --> 30:14.200
this saying

30:14.559 --> 30:16.240
will come into play sooner or later.

30:22.399 --> 30:23.760
You must be suffering.

30:25.760 --> 30:27.679
I'm the Crown Prince.

30:28.680 --> 30:30.439
I own the Eastern Palace,

30:31.399 --> 30:33.320
revered by everyone

30:33.720 --> 30:35.720
and envied by my brothers.

30:36.240 --> 30:38.679
What's there to suffer?

30:44.319 --> 30:45.399
Deng,

30:45.520 --> 30:47.079
have one. Don't be shy.

30:48.319 --> 30:50.280
The pastry Mr. Fan made

30:50.760 --> 30:51.980
is delicious.

30:52.000 --> 30:53.399
Here you go. It's hot.

30:55.919 --> 30:57.420
This is my Baba's favorite.

30:57.440 --> 30:57.839
Here.

30:57.839 --> 30:58.800
Sit down and eat.

30:58.800 --> 30:59.740
Thank you. No need for that.

30:59.760 --> 31:00.919
Come on.

31:08.110 --> 31:08.860
Why are you not eating?

31:08.860 --> 31:10.440
It tastes better while it's hot.

31:10.520 --> 31:12.859
Mr. Fan, I'm on duty now.

31:12.879 --> 31:15.159
I will taste it at home.

31:16.079 --> 31:17.059
Deng Ziyue,

31:17.079 --> 31:18.819
you look awkward.

31:18.839 --> 31:21.240
Do you not trust me?

31:21.319 --> 31:22.919
Please forgive me.

31:24.680 --> 31:25.760
I get it.

31:26.319 --> 31:27.740
You still want to observe

31:27.760 --> 31:29.500
and see if I could be the one

31:29.520 --> 31:31.560
to awaken your inner self.

31:31.879 --> 31:32.660
Get up.

31:32.680 --> 31:33.760
Yes.

31:38.200 --> 31:40.079
Is the First Division all set?

31:40.839 --> 31:42.119
Yes.

31:42.639 --> 31:44.780
Everyone in the First Division
is very excited

31:44.800 --> 31:46.139
and can't wait.

31:46.159 --> 31:47.940
Ever since you debated in the hall,

31:47.960 --> 31:49.220
everyone

31:49.240 --> 31:51.780
has admired you more.

31:51.800 --> 31:52.700
Especially me.

31:52.720 --> 31:53.879
I feel like I have found

31:53.879 --> 31:55.560
a beacon.

31:56.440 --> 31:57.740
The person they admire isn't me.

31:57.760 --> 31:59.800
It's Mr. Chen who's on my side.

31:59.879 --> 32:01.910
I'm too young to earn their admiration.

32:04.319 --> 32:05.460
It may be the case for others.

32:05.480 --> 32:07.919
But I'm different from them.

32:08.520 --> 32:09.420
How is it different?

32:09.440 --> 32:10.520
You see,

32:10.720 --> 32:12.780
the strategy you used

32:12.800 --> 32:15.090
is a masterstroke.

32:15.110 --> 32:16.960
You steered the Imperial Procuratorate

32:17.350 --> 32:19.299
into handling
the corruption investigation.

32:19.319 --> 32:20.480
This is brilliant.

32:20.720 --> 32:21.599
I can safely say

32:21.599 --> 32:23.540
you excel in literary and martial arts
and are resourceful.

32:23.540 --> 32:25.119
Eat the pastry, then.

32:26.639 --> 32:28.879
I will eat it later.

32:29.240 --> 32:31.180
According to the rules
of the Imperial Inspectorate,

32:31.200 --> 32:32.299
members

32:32.319 --> 32:34.960
who are on duty
should not eat outside food.

32:35.399 --> 32:36.539
Did I get it right?

32:36.559 --> 32:38.379
You don't want
to break the rules, do you?

32:38.399 --> 32:39.479
Yes.

32:40.359 --> 32:42.159
Despite being submissive

32:42.159 --> 32:43.899
and servile,

32:43.919 --> 32:45.660
why do you still stick

32:45.680 --> 32:47.420
to a trivial rule like this one?

32:47.440 --> 32:49.439
Deng Ziyue, this is self-contradictory.

32:50.440 --> 32:51.639
I'm just dull.

32:52.280 --> 32:53.639
I will go back and eat it.

32:54.040 --> 32:55.399
Oh, my.

32:56.119 --> 32:58.280
Wang, look at him.

32:59.079 --> 33:00.660
If I were to learn from him,

33:00.680 --> 33:02.379
you would find me annoying.

33:02.399 --> 33:04.720
We serve in our own way.

33:05.119 --> 33:06.200
Rightfully so.

33:07.879 --> 33:09.000
Xian!

33:09.960 --> 33:10.700
Xian.

33:10.720 --> 33:12.460
Catch your breath before you talk.

33:12.480 --> 33:14.420
The imperial physician is here.

33:14.440 --> 33:15.660
Who is the imperial physician?

33:15.680 --> 33:17.079
Whoever he is.

33:17.119 --> 33:19.700
According to the imperial physician,
the Second Prince sent him over

33:19.700 --> 33:21.510
because he was worried
about you and Father's sickness.

33:21.510 --> 33:23.780
Aunt is showing him the way
to Father's room.

33:23.800 --> 33:24.660
What should we do?

33:24.680 --> 33:25.579
I'm going to stop him.

33:25.599 --> 33:26.840
Why stop him?

33:26.860 --> 33:28.339
The imperial physician must be stopped.

33:28.359 --> 33:29.460
Father's face is radiating.

33:29.480 --> 33:30.859
He doesn't look sick at all.

33:30.879 --> 33:32.520
Coming from his own daughter.

33:32.680 --> 33:34.740
Are you not happy
when Father is healthy?

33:34.760 --> 33:35.859
Xian.

33:35.879 --> 33:38.079
Don't worry. He can manage this.

33:39.040 --> 33:40.180
Falling ill

33:40.200 --> 33:41.599
is a piece of cake.

33:45.079 --> 33:46.220
Physician Li,

33:46.240 --> 33:47.359
this isn't serious.

33:47.359 --> 33:49.720
It's trouble for you
to come all the way here.

33:50.000 --> 33:51.080
It's my duty.

33:51.960 --> 33:53.099
Please come this way.

33:53.119 --> 33:54.679
Mind the steps.

33:56.159 --> 33:57.679
Madam, what are you looking for?

33:57.720 --> 33:59.359
Oh, nothing.

34:03.280 --> 34:04.859
Is Mr. Fan in his room?

34:04.879 --> 34:06.500
I think so.

34:06.520 --> 34:07.720
I shall check on him.

34:08.800 --> 34:10.819
Would you like some tea first?

34:10.839 --> 34:12.800
No thanks.
The patient is more important.

34:13.160 --> 34:14.760
Why didn't anyone come and stop us?

34:14.760 --> 34:16.359
They should at least give a hint.

34:16.999 --> 34:17.800
It's nothing, really.

34:17.800 --> 34:18.680
I'm saying

34:18.680 --> 34:19.479
the illness came

34:19.479 --> 34:21.250
without giving a hint.

34:21.270 --> 34:22.439
Illness always caught us off guard.

34:22.439 --> 34:23.700
Please don't worry, Madam.

34:23.720 --> 34:25.039
I will go and check on him.

34:26.800 --> 34:28.160
Since the imperial physician is here,

34:28.160 --> 34:29.839
it's almost time.

34:29.879 --> 34:31.919
Tell the First Division
to spread the word.

34:32.120 --> 34:33.200
Yes.

34:43.120 --> 34:45.320
He looks terrible.

34:45.439 --> 34:47.039
Is he terminally sick?

34:47.200 --> 34:48.280
Don't panic.

35:03.640 --> 35:05.800
Xian, is Father sick?

35:05.839 --> 35:06.859
No.

35:06.879 --> 35:08.180
He is healthier than me.

35:08.200 --> 35:09.090
What then?

35:09.110 --> 35:10.939
What if the imperial physician
finds this out?

35:10.959 --> 35:13.150
If he finds out Father isn't sick,
it's even worse.

35:13.280 --> 35:16.399
It's deceiving the Emperor.

35:17.080 --> 35:18.100
Ruoruo,

35:18.120 --> 35:20.580
think about it. If one skips
the assembly due to body condition,

35:20.600 --> 35:22.160
what else could it be

35:22.600 --> 35:23.800
besides falling ill?

35:41.200 --> 35:42.320
Mr. Fan.

35:44.399 --> 35:46.999
Mr. Fan, please show your tongue.

35:55.680 --> 35:57.760
Mr. Fan, please rest well.

36:04.959 --> 36:06.959
Mr. Fan isn't sick.

36:07.839 --> 36:08.939
No way.

36:08.959 --> 36:10.240
He is poisoned.

36:11.439 --> 36:12.419
Poisoned?

36:12.439 --> 36:13.919
Indeed.

36:14.879 --> 36:16.280
Terrific...

36:17.839 --> 36:19.839
Terrible.

36:20.640 --> 36:22.100
Madam, please be more cautious

36:22.120 --> 36:24.760
and investigate if suspicious people
sneak into the residence.

36:25.399 --> 36:27.200
Yes, you are right.

36:27.399 --> 36:29.999
Let's go and check on Mr. Fan Xian.

36:30.399 --> 36:31.459
Again?

36:31.479 --> 36:32.919
Well, I'm already here.

36:33.600 --> 36:34.680
As you wish.

36:39.160 --> 36:40.879
Did you poison Father?

36:42.359 --> 36:44.500
Since we are putting on a show,
we should put in more effort.

36:44.520 --> 36:45.700
Does Father know about this?

36:45.720 --> 36:47.819
Of course.
Why would I hide this from him?

36:47.839 --> 36:49.160
Didn't he say anything?

36:52.185 --> 36:53.265
Poison?

36:53.519 --> 36:54.379
Don't worry.

36:54.399 --> 36:56.419
I'm an expert in this.

36:56.439 --> 36:58.559
This is very safe.

36:58.720 --> 36:59.919
It takes effect immediately.

36:59.919 --> 37:01.320
The outcome is convincing.

37:02.640 --> 37:03.959
It smells good.

37:03.999 --> 37:05.299
After all, you are using it.

37:05.319 --> 37:07.060
I specially formulated the flavor.

37:07.080 --> 37:09.580
It tastes smooth.

37:09.600 --> 37:10.879
Let me try.

37:12.359 --> 37:13.560
You can try it

37:13.560 --> 37:14.620
when a physician comes.

37:14.640 --> 37:15.919
Don't waste it.

37:19.319 --> 37:21.120
It smells pretty good.

37:25.519 --> 37:28.640
Father does trust you very much.

37:29.280 --> 37:30.859
Will you use the poison too?

37:30.879 --> 37:32.060
Why would I use it?

37:32.080 --> 37:34.280
The imperial physician
will also check on you.

37:36.920 --> 37:38.540
No one will be convinced
that I'm poisoned.

37:38.560 --> 37:40.999
Everyone knows I'm Fei Jie's disciple.

37:41.800 --> 37:44.280
Will they suspect you
of poisoning Father?

37:44.280 --> 37:45.519
Impossible.

37:45.560 --> 37:46.780
No one would believe

37:46.800 --> 37:47.820
a son poisoned his own father.

37:47.820 --> 37:49.460
Can he even call himself a human?

37:52.160 --> 37:53.839
Am I cursing myself?

37:54.519 --> 37:55.680
Not really.

37:55.800 --> 37:57.419
You are the Immortal Poet.

37:57.439 --> 37:58.959
Immortal isn't human.

37:58.959 --> 38:01.220
You are not cursing yourself
because you are not even a human.

38:01.240 --> 38:02.919
So, are you cursing me right now?

38:03.760 --> 38:05.479
You sure have a way with words.

38:06.839 --> 38:08.280
Fan Xian!

38:09.959 --> 38:11.600
The imperial physician is here!

38:11.919 --> 38:13.640
Are you up?

38:14.720 --> 38:16.559
Thank you so much, sir.

38:17.519 --> 38:19.060
Sorry for the trouble, sir.

38:19.080 --> 38:21.100
You haven't had some tea yet.

38:21.120 --> 38:22.459
Fan Xian.

38:22.479 --> 38:24.140
The imperial physician is here.

38:24.160 --> 38:25.720
Are you up?

38:27.319 --> 38:28.640
Fan Xian.

38:29.319 --> 38:31.100
Get up and greet the imperial physician.

38:31.120 --> 38:33.039
He is going to diagnose you.

38:34.640 --> 38:35.879
Fan Xian?

38:38.600 --> 38:39.760
Fan Xian.

38:39.919 --> 38:41.819
Madam, please do away with formalities.

38:41.839 --> 38:43.740
Mr. Fan is sick,

38:43.760 --> 38:45.070
and he may have difficulty walking.

38:45.080 --> 38:47.200
I can go inside myself.

38:53.280 --> 38:55.039
Aunt, you are here.

38:55.760 --> 38:57.039
Fan Xian.

38:57.080 --> 39:00.760
He comes all the way
from the Imperial Academy of Medicine.

39:01.120 --> 39:02.200
Thank...

39:03.080 --> 39:04.280
Thank you.

39:04.319 --> 39:05.399
Mr. Fan.

39:05.519 --> 39:07.120
Poor Mr. Fan.

39:07.399 --> 39:08.959
You should be

39:09.280 --> 39:12.280
resting in bed.

39:12.280 --> 39:13.979
Why did you insist on getting up

39:13.999 --> 39:15.140
and saying

39:15.160 --> 39:17.899
that you want to show respect to Madam

39:17.919 --> 39:22.220
and be grateful
to the imperial physician?

39:22.240 --> 39:26.039
Why don't you think about yourself?

39:26.080 --> 39:27.499
There is no need to freak out.

39:27.519 --> 39:28.959
He is breathing.

39:29.120 --> 39:31.519
Please save him, sir.

39:31.800 --> 39:33.519
I will do my best.

39:35.359 --> 39:37.080
His pulse...

39:37.160 --> 39:38.260
Is he poisoned?

39:38.280 --> 39:39.600
No.

39:39.839 --> 39:42.200
Has Mr. Fan been hit
by something recently?

39:42.680 --> 39:44.439
Did he?

39:45.839 --> 39:46.919
What's wrong?

39:47.360 --> 39:49.120
The circulation of his qi and blood
is out of control.

39:49.120 --> 39:50.220
It doesn't seem like he's sick.

39:50.240 --> 39:51.760
More like a serious injury.

39:53.560 --> 39:54.640
Mr. Fan.

39:59.439 --> 40:00.540
Have you eaten yet?

40:00.560 --> 40:01.720
Not yet.

40:02.919 --> 40:04.959
Then, go home and eat.

40:07.519 --> 40:10.120
Did his mind go wrong after being hit?

40:11.240 --> 40:12.919
Who sent you here?

40:13.640 --> 40:14.879
It's the Second Prince.

40:15.680 --> 40:17.479
Please thank him for me.

40:17.760 --> 40:19.320
I will relay your message to him.

40:20.959 --> 40:22.160
Aunt,

40:22.280 --> 40:26.250
please make sure he eats before leaving.

40:26.270 --> 40:28.399
I will order the kitchen
to prepare food later.

40:29.160 --> 40:30.240
Mr. Fan.

40:30.319 --> 40:32.419
Mr. Fan is weak now.

40:32.439 --> 40:34.780
Please take him back
to his room so he can rest.

40:34.800 --> 40:36.379
I will issue a prescription for him.

40:36.399 --> 40:37.459
Sure.

40:37.479 --> 40:39.240
Thank you so much, sir.

40:40.039 --> 40:41.240
It's my duty.

40:41.999 --> 40:45.959
There are more good people
in the Qing State.

40:53.160 --> 40:55.359
Do you want to grab a bite?

40:56.680 --> 40:58.320
Just to make sure,

40:58.399 --> 40:59.760
let's rehearse again.

40:59.879 --> 41:00.250
Let's start.

41:00.270 --> 41:02.359
Have you heard
about the Baoyue Pleasure House?

41:02.760 --> 41:03.290
Yes.

41:03.310 --> 41:05.100
The youngest son of the Fan family
owns it.

41:05.120 --> 41:06.519
Someone died there.

41:07.120 --> 41:08.339
Someone saw

41:08.359 --> 41:10.740
that the head there was Yuan Meng.

41:10.760 --> 41:13.600
She is Madam Yuan
from the Liujing River.

41:13.640 --> 41:17.439
It's rumored
that she's Prince Jing's woman.

41:17.680 --> 41:18.919
Remember

41:19.319 --> 41:20.939
to spread the news

41:20.959 --> 41:23.460
to every corner of the Capital
as quickly as possible.

41:23.480 --> 41:24.499
This is of significance.

41:24.519 --> 41:25.740
I'm counting on you.

41:25.760 --> 41:27.439
For the sake of the Qing State!

41:27.520 --> 41:29.170
For the sake of the Qing State!

41:31.680 --> 41:32.940
Chop-chop.

41:32.960 --> 41:33.899
We don't have much time.

41:33.919 --> 41:35.280
No mistake.

41:44.839 --> 41:45.939
Did he really say that?

41:45.959 --> 41:47.039
Yes.

41:47.200 --> 41:48.680
The imperial physician said

41:48.800 --> 41:51.440
Fan Jian had been poisoned,
and Fan Xian was seriously injured.

41:51.760 --> 41:53.420
He also said
that he had years of experience

41:53.440 --> 41:54.879
and wouldn't make a mistake.

41:57.359 --> 41:58.760
Fan Jian was poisoned

41:59.479 --> 42:00.859
by Fan Xian.

42:00.879 --> 42:01.819
Fan Xian?

42:01.839 --> 42:02.999
It can't be.

42:04.280 --> 42:05.360
You see,

42:05.440 --> 42:07.140
you didn't believe it
when I told the truth.

42:07.160 --> 42:08.680
Will others believe this?

42:12.240 --> 42:13.800
I can understand the poisoning.

42:15.439 --> 42:17.359
But where did Fan Xian's
injury come from?

42:19.439 --> 42:20.519
Mr. Fan,

42:20.839 --> 42:22.780
are you really fine?

42:22.800 --> 42:24.519
I'm good. It's just a performance.

42:25.039 --> 42:26.999
What is a performance?

42:26.999 --> 42:28.250
It's an act.

42:28.270 --> 42:29.959
A little sunshine will do me good.

42:38.120 --> 42:40.200
How come it's not sunny today?

42:41.399 --> 42:42.479
Xian,

42:43.560 --> 42:45.160
this is the prescription.

42:48.640 --> 42:49.780
The prescription is fine.

42:49.800 --> 42:51.630
The imperial physician is skilled.

42:52.160 --> 42:53.839
But how did you manage to fool him?

42:53.959 --> 42:54.959
Feigning illness is easy

42:54.959 --> 42:56.959
for martial artists like me.

42:57.680 --> 42:58.839
You are amazing.

43:16.260 --> 43:18.260
♪ The youth raises his head ♪

43:18.260 --> 43:22.340
♪ As he moves toward his moon ♪

43:23.860 --> 43:25.980
♪ People tease him for being delusional ♪

43:25.980 --> 43:29.760
♪ Wondering why he is so unconventional ♪

43:31.780 --> 43:35.340
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

43:35.340 --> 43:39.260
♪ How could it remain unstained? ♪

43:39.260 --> 43:41.180
♪ If silver tael has a value ♪

43:41.180 --> 43:44.780
♪ Who can truly be carefree? ♪

43:45.500 --> 43:48.180
♪ All of you are right ♪

43:48.200 --> 43:50.420
♪ He said: "Please" ♪

43:50.420 --> 43:53.480
♪ "Make way" ♪

43:53.500 --> 43:55.980
♪ "Let me drink until I drop" ♪

43:55.980 --> 43:57.900
♪ On the court ♪

43:57.900 --> 44:00.920
♪ I recite several verses ♪

44:00.940 --> 44:03.340
♪ Let me wear a white robe ♪

44:03.340 --> 44:05.420
♪ And cross the alley
filled with insanity ♪

44:05.420 --> 44:08.640
♪ To scoop up the moon's reflection
in the muddy pond ♪

44:08.660 --> 44:10.900
♪ Sirs, please forgive me ♪

44:10.900 --> 44:12.860
♪ Your words of advice ♪

44:12.860 --> 44:15.880
♪ I understand,
but I don't want to pretend ♪

44:15.900 --> 44:18.190
♪ People search for the golden land ♪

44:18.190 --> 44:20.260
♪ While I search for the moon ♪

44:20.260 --> 44:22.720
♪ Why should we travel together? ♪

44:22.740 --> 44:24.660
♪ Thank you ♪

44:24.660 --> 44:26.740
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:26.740 --> 44:28.420
♪ You are you ♪

44:28.420 --> 44:30.320
♪ I am me ♪

44:30.340 --> 44:32.260
♪ Thank you ♪

44:32.260 --> 44:34.220
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:34.220 --> 44:36.020
♪ You are you ♪

44:36.020 --> 44:39.480
♪ I am me ♪

44:51.550 --> 44:54.770
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

44:55.150 --> 44:58.620
♪ Remarkably worldly-wise
yet hopelessly romantic ♪

44:58.870 --> 45:02.010
♪ Know what you love ♪

45:02.200 --> 45:04.770
♪ Don't change ♪

45:06.660 --> 45:10.090
♪ If one has witnessed
both light and shadow ♪

45:10.160 --> 45:13.790
♪ Yet retains their innocence ♪

45:13.810 --> 45:16.840
♪ They shall be cloaked in moonlight ♪

45:16.900 --> 45:20.100
♪ As they journey through the night ♪
